 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Like Him Even More Because He's My Ex-husband"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "전남편이라서 더 좋아"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Like It Better Because He's My Ex-Husband"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A Love-in-Love That Begins Only After Divorce—With My Ex-Husband!\n\nA new branch director has just been appointed.\n\nAnd guess what? That director... is my ex-husband!\n\nThere was a company dinner that night.\n\nI opened my eyes and… I was in a bed.\n\nThe man lying next to me? My ex-husband.\n\nI barely managed to scramble out without even dressing properly…\n\nThen he called me into his office—no, my ex-husband called me in.\n\n“Did you forget something?”\n\n“Wh-what…?”\n\n“This!”\n\nWhat he handed me… was a gift box.\n\nInside? A whole set of sexy lingerie.\n\n“From now on, wear things like this.”"
  },
